Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:11:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] build: install runtime resources for libghostty on Linux

Embedders of libghostty on Linux (app-runtime=none) have no app bundle
that provides terminfo, shell integration and themes, so install the
same resources the GTK app installs alongside the library.

diff --git a/build.zig b/build.zig
index d09cc177d..0e6b0d604 100644
--- a/build.zig
+++ b/build.zig
@@ -236,6 +236,11 @@ pub fn build(b: *std.Build) !void {
             } else {
                 lib_shared.install("ghostty-internal.so");
                 lib_static.install("ghostty-internal.a");
+
+                // Embedders on Linux need the same runtime resources as
+                // the GTK app (terminfo, shell integration, themes) since
+                // there is no app bundle to provide them.
+                resources.install();
             }
         }
     }
